### 1. Add Student 1 (Excellent - Stronger in Programming)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 101,
  "studentName": "Aarav Sharma",
  "email": "aarav@example.com",
  "courseName": "CSE",
  "programmingScore": 92.0,
  "mathematicsScore": 84.0,
  "technicalSkills": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "MySQL"]
}

### 2. Add Student 2 (Good - Stronger in Math)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 102,
  "studentName": "Priya Verma",
  "email": "priya@example.com",
  "courseName": "CSEAI",
  "programmingScore": 72.0,
  "mathematicsScore": 86.0,
  "technicalSkills": ["Python", "Java", "Machine Learning"]
}

### 3. Add Student 3 (Weak in Programming <50, Strong in Math >=75)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 103,
  "studentName": "Rohan Gupta",
  "email": "rohan@example.com",
  "courseName": "IT",
  "programmingScore": 42.0,
  "mathematicsScore": 82.0,
  "technicalSkills": ["MySQL", "HTML"]
}

### 4. Validation Check (Duplicate ID or Invalid Score > 100)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 101,
  "studentName": "Duplicate User",
  "email": "dup@example.com",
  "courseName": "CSE",
  "programmingScore": 105.0,
  "mathematicsScore": 90.0,
  "technicalSkills": ["C++"]
}

### 5. Retrieve All Students
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

### 6. Search Student by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/101

### 7. Search Student by Email & Course
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search/email?email=priya@example.com

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/search/course?course=CSE

### 8. Display Merit List (Sorted by Average Score Descending)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/merit-list

### 9. Group Students with Same Technical Skills
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/skills-group

### 10. Weak in Programming (<50) & Strong in Math (>=75)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/math-strong

### 11. Update Student Scores and Skills
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/103
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "programmingScore": 65.0,
  "mathematicsScore": 85.0,
  "technicalSkills": ["MySQL", "Java"]
}

### 12. Delete Student Record
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/students/102
